Z||000003||Monkeyman||12-01-2001||03:37 AM||||If it's the one about 4 rows up from the bottom, it's Eddy Snaaws dash.  He sold the molds to some kid in Las Vegas who claimed he was going to sell the dashes at a reasonable price.  A year later, he decides to sell his own chopped up version for around $2500USD.  He's a bastard (the new seller, not Eddy).  Eddy said that he threw out his backup molds and sold the car that the original dash was in.  Too bad as I would have bought his dash.  Do a search for "Eddy Snaaw".  ||||reg||1
